WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.030
- (Kelly) Speaking of cooking,

00:00:01.030 --> 00:00:03.660
is it true that you actually
cooked with Meryl Streep

00:00:03.660 --> 00:00:06.673
in her apartment while
making Julia &amp; Julia?

00:00:07.546 --> 00:00:08.379
- We did.

00:00:08.379 --> 00:00:13.379
We, we cooked together when
we're about to start the film.

00:00:13.880 --> 00:00:16.960
I asked her if we could cook together,

00:00:16.960 --> 00:00:20.040
we had both finished shooting films prior,

00:00:20.040 --> 00:00:23.020
and I knew she was busy and tired,

00:00:23.020 --> 00:00:26.280
but I said not to be too method-ie,

00:00:26.280 --> 00:00:28.130
but could we just cook together?

00:00:28.130 --> 00:00:30.260
And we did. And we had a great time.

00:00:30.260 --> 00:00:32.660
We cooked one of Julia's recipes.

00:00:32.660 --> 00:00:34.750
We cooked the Blanquette de Veau,

00:00:34.750 --> 00:00:37.897
which is a sort of creamy veal dish.

00:00:37.897 --> 00:00:39.500
And it ended up being delicious.

00:00:39.500 --> 00:00:41.980
However, it was, we were too slow

00:00:41.980 --> 00:00:45.115
and we thought we're going
to serve dinner at eight,

00:00:45.115 --> 00:00:46.816
we served it at a 10.

00:00:46.816 --> 00:00:47.650
(Laughter)

00:00:47.650 --> 00:00:49.970
- This is my problem with cooking. Okay.

00:00:49.970 --> 00:00:52.280
I can actually cook, but it
takes me like three hours

00:00:52.280 --> 00:00:54.950
to do what it takes someone
like 30 minutes to 45 minutes.

00:00:54.950 --> 00:00:56.010
I'm so slow.

00:00:56.010 --> 00:00:58.460
Cause I get nervous and I
triple check everything,

00:00:58.460 --> 00:01:00.990
but that's, like, quite a
recipe to like, be like,

00:01:00.990 --> 00:01:02.660
let's our first time cooking together.

00:01:02.660 --> 00:01:05.930
You just jumped right into
like a really hard recipe.

00:01:05.930 --> 00:01:07.089
That's amazing.

00:01:07.089 --> 00:01:07.922
- (Stanley Tucci) Yeah we did.

00:01:07.922 --> 00:01:11.180
And she, she had made a tarte tatin

00:01:11.180 --> 00:01:15.353
based on a Julia's recipe,
that was actually delicious.

